33. GOLDEN RULE
------------------------------------------------------------

Need to know:

    "Does this exist?"
        -> unordered_set


    "How many times?"
        -> unordered_map


    "Where was it?"
        -> unordered_map


    "What is the value associated with this key?"
        -> unordered_map


    "Do I need sorted keys?"
        -> map / set



